 "provenance": "Bavaria 7 (w1 l6) normal exit 30,21, control-only on the exact S700 core, no damage and no deaths. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes, as in the certified secret route of this stage), weaponTier 2 (hook from the Bavaria 3 chest; Bavaria 4+ start with tier 2), maxHealth 4, 0 diamonds. Route: (1) entrance to checkpoint 23,36; hammer bridge switch 25,37 from 25,38, hook stone 24,32 aside, hammer switch 23,34 from 24,34 and climb column 25 through the lowered bridges, grass 25,27 and the brick rows to row 21. (2) From 20,20 hook stone 18,20 (action facing left, t576); it is pulled into column 19, falls on the two snakes there and kills them; the five further action presses at 20,20 (facing down, t606-654) hit nothing and change nothing; checkpoint 2 at 14,23. (3) Cut grass 10,19 and hook the diamond there from 12,19: the ceiling mine 9,16 drops, rolls into column 11 and explodes on the rubble at 11,22 (rubble 10-11,23 gone, stone 10,22 drops into pocket 10,26); hook stones 9,22 and 8,22 from 11,22 into column 10 and push the second along row 25 into 8,26 so the pocket 8-10,26 is filled; hammer grass 6,25 from 6,24: roller 5,25 rolls along row 25 and destroys crusher 13,24-25. (4) Bridge room: hook mine 9,29 from 11,29, push mine 12,30 left from 13,30, hook mine 14,29 from 12,29 (it explodes at 13,31), toggle all bridges with switch 8,31 from 8,30, step to 8,29 while roller 6,29 passes, walk through grass 5,29/4,29 to checkpoint 3 (3,29) before mine 5,28 drops and explodes at 5,30. (5) Brick shaft cols 1-2: break the brick groups upward from 2,27, 1,25, 2,22 and 2,19; after the last strike wait 40 ticks for the column-1 stones to pass, step to 1,19 and climb column 1 while the column-2 stone falls; checkpoint 4 at 1,12. (6) Upper-left (found by macro search, no damage): walk into grass 5,10, hammer left from 5,10, walk into grass 6,10, wait for the falling stones and mines to settle, hammer up from 3,11, walk through grass 3,10 and 3,9, then through grass 9,5; checkpoint 5 at 11,5. (7) Time the fast ceiling traps 12-14,3, hammer bricks 16,4-5 from 15,5, retreat to 11,5 while mines 16,3 and 17,3 drop and explode, cross back to 15,5, step up to 15,4 and walk along row 4 (16,4 ... 24,4, taking the diamond at 22,4 at t3088), then down column 24 to 24,15. (8) Riddle room 2 (trigger 26,15, checkpoint 6 at 27,15; gates 25,15/33,15 close): snake A patrols column 28 and snake B column 32; from 30,17 hook snake B from 32,17 to 31,17 (facing right, t3359) and snake A from 28,17 to 29,17 (facing left, t3436); one hammer strike from 30,17 facing right (t3492) stuns snake B at 31,17; snake A is not stunned (it walks up to 29,15 and back) and is at 29,17 again only by timing; hammer grass 30,15 from 30,16 (t3513) so mine 30,14 drops to 30,15 above the hero, step to 31,16 and 31,15; the mine falls to 30,17 and explodes (t~3539-3545), killing snake B at 31,17 and snake A at 29,17, gates reopen. (9) Through gate 33,15 and column 34 to row 19, walk into grass 30,19 and push mine 29,19 left twice: it falls two cells and explodes at 27,21, destroying rubble 28,21; walk 27,19-27,21, 28,21, 29,21 (the magic-lock cell: S700 level load clears that tile, field_157/158 = 29,21, so it does not block) and leave through exit 30,21.",
